<title>AUSTRALIA: NAB cuts fixed rate mortgage loans.</title>
<headline>NAB cuts fixed rate mortgage loans.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australia Bank said on Friday it had reduced its fixed rate residential home loans for by up to 0.50 percentage points.</p>
<p>The new rates, available from June 9 are:</p>
<p>					New	    Old     Change</p>
<p>    Package 1 year	     6.50 pct     6.50 pct   -</p>
<p>    Package 2 year	     7.30	   7.50	-0.20</p>
<p>    1 year			 7.10	   7.50	-0.40</p>
<p>    2 year			 7.50	   7.95	-0.45</p>
<p>    3 year			 7.80	   8.30	-0.50</p>
<p>    4 year			 8.20	   8.60	-0.40</p>
<p>    5 year			 8.35	   8.70	-0.35</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
